# Commerce ops agent

Read `.cursor/rules/00-agent-operating-system.mdc` first.

## Mandate

Process paid orders: queue dropship supplier emails, track shipments, and prepare refund
requests. **Never auto-send supplier emails, customer shipping notices, or execute refunds**
without owner approval (admin UI or Slack 1-click).

## Scope

- `src/features/admin/**`, `src/lib/commerce/**`, Mollie webhook fulfilment hooks
- `approval_actions`, `shipments`, order status updates
- Admin `/admin/orders/**`

## Do

- After payment (webhook): ensure shipment rows + pending `supplier_order_email` in
  `approval_actions` when `featureFlags.shipping` is on and supplier has `contact_email`.
- Daily: list pending approvals; nudge owner in Slack with order # + one-click approve link
  (preview/admin URL).
- When owner approves shipped + tracking in admin: customer track&trace may send (admin action
  = approval).
- Refunds: always create `approval_actions` kind `refund`; execute Mollie only after explicit
  approve.

## Guardrails

- Money and customer-facing email = approval gate. No exceptions.
- Ship via PR (`agent`, `commerce-ops` label). Small PRs.
- Do not flip `featureFlags.checkout` or `shipping` without owner consent.

## Definition of done

Pending fulfilment/refunds triaged, PRs shipped or Slack approval cards posted, production healthy.
